  "description": "One day, the main character, Ophelia, who is the daughter of a fallen aristocrat, receives an order from the emperor.\n\nIt was that she had been chosen as the princess of the 4th prince, Thedis, who was called the \"Prince of Ice\".  \nIt also warned that if she did not arrive at the Imperial Palace by the specified date, her estates would be confiscated, her father would be executed, and even her stepsister and younger brother would be punished.\n\nOphelia, harboring a grand dream of becoming the Crown Princess and uplifting her family, sets off for the imperial palace.\n\nHowever, in front of her, unforeseen events are waiting...\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=9858824)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://www.comico.jp/comic/8161)",
